  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design and implementation of a participator y process with youth, grassroots organizations and rural families to improve institutional structures, political and socio-economic conditions in the region of the Duende, Valle del Cauca</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin de Campesinos de la Vereda Palmas (Asocap) will work with Asociacin Comunitaria de Productores de Mora y Dems Cultivos de la Regin (Asocomore) and Fundacin Ecolgica Produende (Produende) to develop the leadership skills and income potential of young residents of the rural municipalities of Darien, Trujillo and Riofrio, department of Valle del Cauca, and will provide them access to materials, supplies, and equipment. The work will benefit 350 Colombians directly and another 1,500 indirectly, and it should motivate young residents to stay and build a future for themselves in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
